<mxCell id="p0b1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:29.0px&quot;&gt;그림 6-2. NIC 큐 · IRQ 배치 : 전체 코어 96 → NUMA 로컬&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#201E1F;strokeColor=#201E1F;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#F7F3EC;fontSize=24.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;NIC 이 붙은 NUMA 의 코어가 그 NIC 의 인터럽트 · 패킷 처리를 맡아야 원격 메모리 접근이 없음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECDDB9;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="62" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;I Lake : 큐 96 · irqbalance&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#969390;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="104" width="660" height="630" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
